WEBVTT

01:32.832 --> 01:35.166
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:35.191 --> 01:37.919
(Adapted from the novel "A City, Waiting for You" by Jiuyuexi)

01:37.999 --> 01:40.785
(Episode 13)

01:51.800 --> 01:53.280
Fired, just like that?

01:54.000 --> 01:55.961
Ding, you're at the top of the list.

01:56.481 --> 01:57.896
(Retrenchment Notice) Ding, all the work you've put in

01:57.921 --> 02:00.681
over the years were wasted. How could they do this?

02:02.800 --> 02:03.961
What should I do now?

02:10.761 --> 02:11.761
Ding.

02:11.921 --> 02:12.921
What's happened?

02:14.161 --> 02:15.161
Yong.

02:15.400 --> 02:18.737
My mom is in the hospital. My wife has to look after our two kids.

02:18.761 --> 02:22.321
I'm the sole breadwinner of the family. Now I've been fired.

02:23.080 --> 02:25.800
How will my family survive?

02:26.721 --> 02:27.721
Calm down first.

02:28.080 --> 02:30.041
Calm down. We'll figure out a way.

02:30.680 --> 02:31.680
What do I do?

02:35.041 --> 02:36.441
This is too unfair.

02:37.921 --> 02:39.857
-My kids are waiting for me. -They fired us just like that.

02:39.881 --> 02:41.297
-That can't be right. -Yeah.

02:41.321 --> 02:43.616
We worked hard for so many years, no?

02:43.640 --> 02:45.001
How are we supposed to live now?

02:57.321 --> 02:58.321
My fellow workers.

02:59.120 --> 03:00.120
At this time,

03:00.360 --> 03:01.680
we must stand together.

03:01.881 --> 03:03.656
Only when we stand united

03:03.680 --> 03:05.640
can we get our due recompense.

03:05.881 --> 03:07.041
We don't want to fight for nothing.

03:07.400 --> 03:09.601
So we have to remain united.

03:10.001 --> 03:11.680
Yes, we have to be united.

03:11.800 --> 03:13.697
Guys, we have to be united. Stand united.

03:13.721 --> 03:14.800
Yes, stand united!

03:15.240 --> 03:17.216
-Stand united! -Okay, stop. Don't make a scene.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.240
Let's remain composed.

03:19.281 --> 03:21.120
That's good. Seeing everyone's vigor

03:21.360 --> 03:23.360
makes me more confident about winning.

03:24.041 --> 03:25.041
Mr. Meng.

03:25.360 --> 03:26.680
The man named Song Zhi Yong

03:26.921 --> 03:28.520
leads the bunch of retrenched workers

03:28.921 --> 03:30.721
to rally at the company every day.

03:31.080 --> 03:33.080
They are demanding for labor compensation.

03:33.481 --> 03:35.080
They said they won't stop otherwise.

03:35.560 --> 03:37.400
Their leader, Song Zhi Yong

03:37.840 --> 03:39.721
is as shameless as one could get.

03:41.161 --> 03:42.441
How much are they asking?

03:42.761 --> 03:45.001
In total, it's about 1.8 million.

03:54.441 --> 03:55.441
How about this?

03:56.120 --> 03:57.761
Let Human Resource negotiate with them again.

03:58.240 --> 03:59.240
If that's the best we could get,

03:59.560 --> 04:00.560
then just pay them.

04:01.761 --> 04:02.761
I think

04:03.400 --> 04:04.881
we shouldn't give them even one cent.

04:05.360 --> 04:08.400
We must never compromise with a guy like Song Zhi Yong.

04:08.640 --> 04:09.640
Just let it go.

04:10.520 --> 04:13.096
If this matter gets out of hand, the company reputation would be affected.

04:13.120 --> 04:14.417
That would cause more problems.

04:14.441 --> 04:15.520
This is about principle.

04:15.680 --> 04:17.041
If you make an exception this time,

04:17.521 --> 04:18.521
what will happen next time?

04:18.760 --> 04:20.680
Whoever causes a ruckus gets their money.

04:22.760 --> 04:26.760
Besides, we are currently undergoing structural changes.

04:26.921 --> 04:29.000
We don't have any spare funds.

04:29.081 --> 04:30.081
I agree.

04:30.521 --> 04:31.841
We must not pay.

04:32.120 --> 04:33.360
Those bunch of people

04:33.841 --> 04:34.841
are just beggars.

04:35.281 --> 04:37.017
-They only want money. -Greedy lot.

04:37.041 --> 04:38.041
No way we're paying.

04:44.521 --> 04:45.521
Song Yan.

04:45.760 --> 04:48.120
Sleep early after you finish your homework.

04:49.120 --> 04:50.120
Okay, Mom.

04:55.760 --> 04:56.841
I'm going out.

04:57.721 --> 04:58.880
Don't go off playing outside after you finish.

05:00.360 --> 05:01.360
Okay.

05:03.601 --> 05:04.601
Where are you going?

05:04.880 --> 05:05.961
I'm going to the dance hall.

05:07.360 --> 05:09.841
What? Can you please stay away from those places?

05:10.320 --> 05:11.320
What kind of place?

05:11.921 --> 05:13.481
Did I lose my freedom because I married you?

05:16.880 --> 05:19.481
I mean, the dance hall is filled with men and women.

05:19.961 --> 05:21.457
Getting so close to one another in summer...

05:21.481 --> 05:22.880
It's not proper.

05:23.120 --> 05:24.200
You want to manage my affairs?

05:25.041 --> 05:26.401
Just like how you manage your colleagues'?

05:28.000 --> 05:31.161
Tell me. Do they pay you for helping them or what?

05:31.360 --> 05:32.481
If you're that free,

05:32.601 --> 05:35.041
you should fix the family up properly.

05:35.240 --> 05:36.601
Did I not fix it up?

05:36.721 --> 05:38.360
Did I starve you? Did I not let you dress nicely?

05:38.521 --> 05:39.521
What more do you want?

05:39.680 --> 05:41.057
All you ever talk about is money.

05:41.081 --> 05:42.161
Give it a rest.

05:43.041 --> 05:44.800
Other people who works in the same position as you

05:44.961 --> 05:46.320
have fat wallets and full accounts.

05:47.161 --> 05:48.257
They drive big cards

05:48.281 --> 05:49.601
and live in big houses.

05:50.161 --> 05:51.200
What do you have?

05:51.721 --> 05:53.760
Aside from a good name, what else do you have?

06:19.601 --> 06:20.601
Dad.

06:21.200 --> 06:22.200
Doing homework?

06:23.641 --> 06:24.921
I got you some mandarins.

06:25.000 --> 06:26.000
Here you go.

06:26.841 --> 06:28.856
Take this one. Peel one for me.

06:28.880 --> 06:30.000
And I'll peel you one.

06:32.161 --> 06:33.161
Let's see if it's sweet.

06:35.041 --> 06:36.281
Your mom is all dressed up today.

06:37.000 --> 06:38.000
Lovely, isn't she?

06:43.601 --> 06:45.401
-Is it sweet? -It's good. Thanks, Dad.

06:45.680 --> 06:46.680
Come, give me a slice.

06:47.000 --> 06:48.000
Okay.

06:52.240 --> 06:53.897
Mr. Zhao, what did I do wrong?

06:53.921 --> 06:56.521
At least tell me before you fire me.

06:56.721 --> 06:58.176
Someone reported you for receiving bribes.

06:58.200 --> 07:00.057
Mr. Zhao, you could've said anything else,

07:00.081 --> 07:01.617
but there's no way I'd take bribes.

07:01.641 --> 07:03.176
Who reported it? Ask them to come.

07:03.200 --> 07:04.416
We'll sort it out face-to-face.

07:04.440 --> 07:05.521
Your good friend.

07:06.041 --> 07:07.041
Ding Ming.

07:08.641 --> 07:10.921
You foolishly led them to ask for recompense from the management.

07:11.120 --> 07:12.521
(But they've long given in.)

07:18.601 --> 07:20.416
I regarded you as my brother and stood up for you!

07:20.440 --> 07:22.656
But you framed me over some dirty money!

07:22.680 --> 07:23.841
How could you do that to me?

07:24.360 --> 07:25.360
You're inhuman.

07:25.760 --> 07:26.760
You're inhuman!

07:27.320 --> 07:28.736
What benefits did they give you?

07:28.760 --> 07:30.377
What exactly did they give you?

07:30.401 --> 07:32.697
-Tell me! Why are you keeping quiet? -Stop!

07:32.721 --> 07:34.617
-Stop it. -You worthless piece of crap.

07:34.641 --> 07:35.641
Stop fighting.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.240
Go, leave.

08:15.200 --> 08:16.200
Mom!

08:17.200 --> 08:18.200
Mom!

08:19.440 --> 08:20.440
Mom!

09:48.121 --> 09:49.121
Dad.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.480
Good.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.480
Good.

10:28.041 --> 10:30.241
Dad, eat while it's hot.

10:47.720 --> 10:48.720
Dad.

10:49.200 --> 10:50.200
Drink some water.

10:58.320 --> 10:59.320
Dad.

10:59.881 --> 11:02.200
Let me help you to the bed.

11:11.161 --> 11:12.161
Sorry.

11:14.041 --> 11:15.041
I'm sorry.

11:17.001 --> 11:18.001
Dad.

11:18.521 --> 11:19.521
Don't cry, Dad.

11:20.080 --> 11:21.121
Don't cry.

11:21.361 --> 11:22.361
Don't cry.

11:30.361 --> 11:31.361
Dad.

11:32.440 --> 11:33.440
Don't cry.

11:33.840 --> 11:34.840
Don't cry.

11:56.001 --> 11:57.001
Dad.

11:58.440 --> 11:59.921
I want to pee.

12:03.960 --> 12:04.960
Dad.

12:14.960 --> 12:15.960
Dad?

12:29.001 --> 12:30.001
Dad.

12:31.401 --> 12:32.401
Dad!

12:47.361 --> 12:48.361
Dad!

12:49.361 --> 12:50.560
Dad, why are you out here?

12:56.881 --> 12:58.121
You can't sleep here.

12:58.560 --> 12:59.560
Dad!

13:46.001 --> 13:47.816
Look how big the hornet's nest is.

13:47.840 --> 13:49.041
It's dangerous.

13:51.200 --> 13:52.840
I poked a bee hive for fun when I was a kid.

13:53.041 --> 13:54.576
I almost got beaten to death by my dad.

13:54.600 --> 13:56.480
Guess you really deserve your name.

13:56.641 --> 13:57.921
Ge, get a ladder.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.241
You two, put on the protection suit.

13:59.960 --> 14:01.200
-Got it. -Jun Ping.

14:01.361 --> 14:02.361
Disperse the nearby crowd.

14:02.440 --> 14:04.056
Move back. Set up a perimeter.

14:04.080 --> 14:05.080
Understood.

14:05.200 --> 14:06.200
Go, put on the suit.

14:08.560 --> 14:10.641
Yang Chi. You and Jiang can sit this out.

14:11.041 --> 14:12.041
(Let the juniors do it.)

14:12.521 --> 14:15.241
All right. This is a chance for the rookies to perform.

14:22.401 --> 14:23.416
-Stay safe! -Okay.

14:23.440 --> 14:24.440
Do a good job.

14:24.720 --> 14:26.161
Somehow, I have a bad feeling.

14:26.320 --> 14:28.241
I'd be shocked if those two bumbling guys can do it.

14:35.560 --> 14:36.560
Captain.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.857
Could you record me?

14:37.881 --> 14:38.881
Record a video.

14:38.921 --> 14:40.560
I'm doing my first ever main mission.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.480
I want to show it to my mom.

14:42.800 --> 14:44.800
-I'll do it just this once. -Thanks, Cap.

14:56.361 --> 14:57.361
Pi Pi.

15:05.440 --> 15:06.440
Captain.

15:08.281 --> 15:09.600
-Pi Pi. -I'll take that.

15:11.361 --> 15:13.041
Captain, take a photo of me.

15:13.921 --> 15:14.921
Cheers.

15:16.401 --> 15:17.521
Da Peng, watch out!

15:20.361 --> 15:21.361
Cap, careful!

15:26.521 --> 15:28.401
-Get him in. -Slowly.

15:28.800 --> 15:30.800
-There you go. -Careful.

15:34.440 --> 15:35.440
Like I said,

15:35.600 --> 15:37.041
we can't be too nice to them.

15:37.761 --> 15:39.656
It's okay, Cap. There's a first time for everything.

15:39.680 --> 15:41.497
That's right. It was Da Peng's first main mission.

15:41.521 --> 15:43.080
And it's your first time getting stung by hornets.

15:43.440 --> 15:44.440
Yeah.

15:44.921 --> 15:46.176
Cap, we'll wait for you outside.

15:46.200 --> 15:47.200
Doctor.

15:47.521 --> 15:48.521
Where were you stung?

15:50.001 --> 15:51.521
I don't see any swollen parts.

15:54.600 --> 15:56.521
-Right hip. -Where?

15:58.361 --> 15:59.361
The butt's ride side.

16:01.041 --> 16:02.041
Take off your pants.

16:05.440 --> 16:07.281
How am I supposed to treat you if you won't show me?

16:07.680 --> 16:09.680
You don't have to treat it. Just get me some medicine.

16:10.001 --> 16:11.480
Some hornets are quite poisonous.

16:12.041 --> 16:14.121
If left unchecked, stings could be lethal.

16:24.200 --> 16:25.200
Must I

16:25.800 --> 16:26.881
do it here?

16:31.881 --> 16:35.041
We can go to the observation room but there are more people there.

16:38.680 --> 16:41.696
The observation room is packed. We should go there and help.

16:41.720 --> 16:43.377
-Is it packed? -Yes.

16:43.401 --> 16:44.656
Lots of people. Let's go.

16:44.680 --> 16:45.680
We're off.

16:46.641 --> 16:47.680
Come on.

16:48.440 --> 16:49.440
Close the door.

16:55.281 --> 16:56.600
You can take it off now.

16:57.560 --> 16:59.840
Doesn't ER have any male medical staff?

17:00.281 --> 17:02.001
Are you doubting my professionalism?

17:03.521 --> 17:04.521
Captain Song.

17:04.960 --> 17:06.121
I think you're thinking too much.

17:07.000 --> 17:08.841
To me, you're just a patient.

17:09.280 --> 17:10.280
Nothing to do with gender.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.000
Take it off.

17:42.520 --> 17:43.520
Captain Song.

17:43.921 --> 17:45.081
I didn't think you'd be so shy.

17:52.680 --> 17:53.680
It's out.

17:56.321 --> 17:58.617
Avoid getting the area wet when you shower. Don't eat spices.

17:58.641 --> 17:59.641
Dr. Xu.

18:00.921 --> 18:03.097
Sorry. The center said

18:03.121 --> 18:05.097
a patient with food poisoning is being sent here.

18:05.121 --> 18:06.121
I'm coming.

18:10.200 --> 18:11.240
Is it done, doctor?

18:12.641 --> 18:13.641
Is everything okay?

18:29.000 --> 18:30.000
Song Yan.

18:33.641 --> 18:34.641
Can we chat?

18:35.960 --> 18:36.960
Wait for me in the truck.

18:42.881 --> 18:43.881
I'm busy.

18:44.040 --> 18:45.040
Make it quick.

18:47.240 --> 18:48.440
I know what you're thinking.

18:50.000 --> 18:51.361
But I urge you to face reality.

18:52.921 --> 18:56.960
You think you could be with her just because she's back?

18:57.960 --> 18:59.480
Even if you're standing next to her,

19:00.121 --> 19:01.841
you two are still not from the same world.

19:03.401 --> 19:04.960
That wall separating you

19:06.000 --> 19:07.081
will always be there.

19:09.321 --> 19:10.321
What a coincidence.

19:11.081 --> 19:12.361
I'm really good

19:12.720 --> 19:13.881
at dismantling walls.

19:17.921 --> 19:18.921
Song Yan.

19:22.040 --> 19:23.240
You and her will never be together.

19:24.121 --> 19:25.601
Can you please just leave her alone?

19:26.000 --> 19:27.121
You're acting like a dog

19:27.801 --> 19:29.401
that is constantly following her.

19:30.680 --> 19:32.200
I'm free to be where I want.

19:32.520 --> 19:33.520
It's not up to you.

19:34.280 --> 19:35.280
Also,

19:35.361 --> 19:36.401
who gave you the right

19:36.641 --> 19:37.641
to decide for her?

19:39.040 --> 19:40.480
If you had the power to decide,

19:40.841 --> 19:42.801
you wouldn't be standing before me right now.

19:43.000 --> 19:44.121
Because I'm her brother.

19:45.561 --> 19:47.401
A family member she can never forsake.

19:47.760 --> 19:49.440
So you know you're her brother.

19:51.561 --> 19:53.121
But your care and possessiveness

19:53.641 --> 19:54.641
over your sister

19:55.240 --> 19:56.480
is a little excessive.

19:56.841 --> 19:58.121
Even as a family member,

19:58.801 --> 20:00.240
you should have a sense of propriety.

20:02.841 --> 20:03.841
I forgot.

20:05.121 --> 20:06.361
You're not her real brother.

20:08.921 --> 20:09.921
Meng Yan Chen.

20:10.601 --> 20:12.801
You don't even dare to face yourself.

20:14.240 --> 20:15.601
What a hypocrite.

20:16.440 --> 20:17.960
Only a guy who can't manage his own life

20:18.161 --> 20:20.561
would impose on other people's lives.

20:53.921 --> 20:56.601
-Nice. -Happy birthday.

20:57.561 --> 20:58.777
-Happy birthday. -Help serve it.

20:58.801 --> 20:59.801
All right.

21:02.161 --> 21:03.161
In the blink of an eye,

21:03.881 --> 21:05.401
the two kids are all grown up.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.720
Indeed.

21:07.520 --> 21:08.601
A child's birthday

21:09.161 --> 21:10.881
is the mother's day of suffering.

21:11.161 --> 21:12.161
Yan Chen.

21:12.361 --> 21:14.881
Your mother went through so much giving birth to you.

21:15.361 --> 21:17.936
She struggled for seven years in the hospital

21:17.960 --> 21:19.401
but couldn't birth you.

21:19.720 --> 21:21.720
At the time, your dad said this child

21:21.921 --> 21:24.361
would surely cause a lot of worry and heartache for me

21:24.440 --> 21:25.841
in the future.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.377
But your dad was wrong.

21:27.401 --> 21:28.401
I said wrong.

21:28.440 --> 21:29.801
Our dear Yan Chen

21:31.480 --> 21:33.520
is the most considerate child a parent could ask for.

21:34.801 --> 21:36.881
He's never made us sad.

21:37.641 --> 21:39.680
Never let us down.

21:39.921 --> 21:41.361
It's all thanks to you.

21:41.401 --> 21:42.416
You are a good mother.

21:42.440 --> 21:43.440
You taught him well.

21:44.801 --> 21:45.881
You raised me well, Mom.

21:46.321 --> 21:47.321
Thank you.

21:47.401 --> 21:48.401
Thank you, Mom.

21:50.000 --> 21:51.256
-Let's start. -Let's.

21:51.280 --> 21:52.720
-Here. -Raise your glasses.

21:52.841 --> 21:54.601
Happy birthday.

22:13.361 --> 22:14.520
The Cypris morpho.

22:15.561 --> 22:16.561
Also known as the Diamond morpho.

22:17.760 --> 22:18.960
They can only be found

22:19.040 --> 22:22.321
in the jungles of Columbia and Panama.

22:22.680 --> 22:23.841
Hope you like it.

22:25.121 --> 22:26.121
Yan Chen.

22:26.480 --> 22:27.480
Happy birthday.

22:27.960 --> 22:29.200
Do you know why these specimens

22:29.760 --> 22:31.000
are so beautiful?

22:32.960 --> 22:34.601
To preserve the vivid colors,

22:35.561 --> 22:40.641
a living butterfly has to gutted bit by bit

22:41.240 --> 22:42.401
without outright killing it.

22:43.280 --> 22:45.760
So while its survival instinct is at its peak,

22:46.081 --> 22:47.520
you need to set it in the final position.

22:49.081 --> 22:50.081
That's so cruel.

22:51.361 --> 22:52.401
Sometimes,

22:52.881 --> 22:54.720
I feel like we're just like them.

22:55.361 --> 22:57.401
We're disciplined by Mom bit by bit.

22:58.440 --> 22:59.720
We lose our ability to think.

23:00.881 --> 23:02.280
We cannot grow out of shape.

23:03.361 --> 23:05.000
There can't be any tarnish or stain.

23:06.361 --> 23:08.361
We have to grow up according to Mom's rules.

23:08.801 --> 23:09.960
We have to be perfect.

23:10.440 --> 23:11.440
Only then,

23:11.881 --> 23:13.240
could we be placed on the wall

23:13.561 --> 23:14.720
and garner people's admiration.

23:16.601 --> 23:17.841
I think it's absurd,

23:18.480 --> 23:19.960
but I can't bring myself to fight it.

23:21.081 --> 23:22.361
Because she is Mom.

23:26.601 --> 23:27.760
Sometimes,

23:28.641 --> 23:30.121
I think it's unfair for you

23:30.601 --> 23:32.200
to be in this family.

23:33.401 --> 23:34.440
But sometimes,

23:34.881 --> 23:36.000
I think selfishly.

23:36.720 --> 23:37.921
With you here,

23:38.641 --> 23:40.321
that would mean I'm not alone.

23:41.720 --> 23:43.081
I wouldn't be so scared then.

23:43.760 --> 23:45.016
Today is your birthday.

23:45.040 --> 23:46.121
Cheer up a little.

23:47.401 --> 23:48.440
And,

23:49.561 --> 23:50.897
I hope we don't argue again.

23:50.921 --> 23:51.921
Okay?

23:56.680 --> 23:58.000
I'm not arguing with you.

23:58.401 --> 23:59.760
I'm just reminding you.

24:00.280 --> 24:01.401
Remind me of what?

24:07.601 --> 24:08.921
Stop looking for Song Yan.

24:12.401 --> 24:14.137
I told you there's no future for you two.

24:14.161 --> 24:16.297
And I told you to stay out of my business.

24:16.321 --> 24:17.401
Qin Qin.

24:17.601 --> 24:18.857
Are you still the little girl

24:18.881 --> 24:20.480
living in a fairy tale world?

24:20.561 --> 24:22.401
Dad and Mom will never agree.

24:22.520 --> 24:25.097
If you want to be with him, you'll have to give up everything.

24:25.121 --> 24:26.240
What's so great about him?

24:26.280 --> 24:27.857
Why would you do all this for him?

24:27.881 --> 24:29.440
It is my own choice.

24:34.641 --> 24:35.720
What are you doing to do?

24:36.601 --> 24:38.081
What do you expect me to do?

24:38.801 --> 24:41.121
Watch you plead with Dad and Mom over him?

24:41.361 --> 24:43.200
Or watch your relationship

24:43.480 --> 24:45.000
with Dad and Mom disintegrate?

24:45.760 --> 24:47.960
At this time, should I be backing you up

24:48.321 --> 24:49.760
or shouldn't I?

24:50.921 --> 24:51.921
Qin Qin.

24:52.361 --> 24:54.801
Are you really going to give up Mom and Dad,

24:55.081 --> 24:56.280
this family, and me

24:56.520 --> 24:57.680
just to be with him?

24:57.921 --> 25:01.121
Why must I give up on family if I wish to be with Song Yan?

25:01.520 --> 25:02.537
Mom didn't like him before

25:02.561 --> 25:04.601
because of his lowly family background.

25:05.200 --> 25:07.121
But Song Yan is doing good now.

25:07.161 --> 25:08.256
He's a fire station captain.

25:08.280 --> 25:09.641
He's saved many lives.

25:10.960 --> 25:13.081
Yes, there were some misunderstandings and friction in the past.

25:13.401 --> 25:15.601
But it can all be resolved with proper communication.

25:17.121 --> 25:18.240
I will find a way

25:18.680 --> 25:20.280
to slowly but surely convince Mom and Dad.

25:20.801 --> 25:22.297
That's just your own wishful thinking.

25:22.321 --> 25:23.857
Mom and Dad will never agree.

25:23.881 --> 25:24.921
Neither will I.

25:27.841 --> 25:29.280
You can be with whoever else.

25:29.841 --> 25:31.760
-But not him! -Why?

25:31.921 --> 25:34.321
If you're willing to turn on the family to be with him,

25:34.960 --> 25:36.520
-then why can't we... -Meng Yan Chen!

25:42.200 --> 25:43.200
Have you lost your mind?

26:08.760 --> 26:10.121
I won't give this family up.

26:13.280 --> 26:14.641
And you'll always be my brother.

26:41.881 --> 26:43.577
I can't believe you still brought it home.

26:43.601 --> 26:45.121
If Mom finds out, you're dead.

26:45.161 --> 26:46.361
Because someone said

26:46.440 --> 26:47.720
they dreamt about eating it.

26:48.321 --> 26:49.377
The smell is strong.

26:49.401 --> 26:50.641
Mom will notice.

26:56.200 --> 26:57.200
Here.

27:12.601 --> 27:14.337
If you get into trouble, leave me out of it.

27:14.361 --> 27:15.401
It's not my fault.

27:16.401 --> 27:17.520
If I die,

27:17.881 --> 27:20.801
then no one's going to bring you nice foods again.

27:21.280 --> 27:22.960
And you won't have anyone to play with.

27:28.321 --> 27:29.577
Why are you gorging it down?

27:29.601 --> 27:30.601
Eat slowly.

27:31.720 --> 27:32.881
I have to gorge.

27:33.161 --> 27:35.561
I can't let Mom find out and take your life.

27:39.440 --> 27:40.656
Come, face me.

27:40.680 --> 27:42.161
-It's so good. -Wipe your mouth.

27:45.361 --> 27:46.416
It's delicious. Do you want some?

27:46.440 --> 27:47.440
No thanks.

28:15.760 --> 28:16.760
Meng Qin?

28:18.121 --> 28:19.121
That's right.

28:19.720 --> 28:21.081
We should've changed it long ago.

28:22.081 --> 28:24.081
We've long accepted you as our daughter.

28:24.200 --> 28:25.881
You shouldn't remain as a Xu.

28:27.081 --> 28:28.121
But...

28:29.121 --> 28:30.121
But what?

28:30.760 --> 28:31.760
Mom.

28:31.921 --> 28:32.921
Regarding this,

28:33.081 --> 28:34.601
I think you should respect what she thinks.

28:35.480 --> 28:36.480
Qin Qin.

28:37.240 --> 28:38.720
What do you think then?

28:39.720 --> 28:40.881
All this while,

28:41.680 --> 28:43.680
did you not think of me as your mother?

28:44.240 --> 28:45.280
No, Mom.

28:45.401 --> 28:46.401
I...

28:46.561 --> 28:48.361
I just wish to keep my original surname.

28:51.760 --> 28:52.760
Then...

28:53.561 --> 28:56.000
I guess you're not happy with Dad.

28:57.000 --> 28:58.000
It's not that.

28:58.280 --> 28:59.720
Dad treats me very well.

29:04.680 --> 29:06.121
Then what is the reason?

29:06.321 --> 29:07.337
Why are you so against

29:07.361 --> 29:08.817
being one family with us

29:08.841 --> 29:10.081
and take the same surname?

29:13.480 --> 29:14.480
Mom.

29:14.520 --> 29:15.857
We are already a family.

29:15.881 --> 29:17.680
-The surname... -I didn't ask you.

29:19.240 --> 29:20.240
That's enough.

29:21.280 --> 29:23.641
If Qin Qin is not willing, why force her?

29:24.680 --> 29:26.641
Not having the surname Meng is not important.

29:26.921 --> 29:28.000
If she's not Meng,

29:28.081 --> 29:29.280
does it mean she's not my daughter?

29:29.480 --> 29:31.081
It is very important.

29:31.280 --> 29:32.641
It has to be changed.

29:33.520 --> 29:35.537
The daughter of the Meng family has the surname Xu.

29:35.561 --> 29:36.656
If people found out,

29:36.680 --> 29:39.000
what would they make of it?

29:39.720 --> 29:42.321
They'd think we got a child bride.

29:45.440 --> 29:47.401
-Wen Ying, could you let this... -Dad.

29:48.361 --> 29:49.601
I will take on your surname.

29:50.401 --> 29:53.561
This is my home. All of you are my family.

29:55.561 --> 29:56.561
All right.

29:57.081 --> 29:58.081
That's good, then.

29:58.760 --> 29:59.760
Well...

30:01.040 --> 30:02.040
Eat.

30:08.081 --> 30:09.081
(Mom.)

30:09.520 --> 30:11.401
Why did you force Qin Qin to change her surname?

30:12.040 --> 30:14.561
That's the only thing her birth parents left her with.

30:15.280 --> 30:19.000
Is that the real reason why you don't want her to change it?

30:21.601 --> 30:22.960
You better think before you speak.

30:26.801 --> 30:28.641
If she wants to remain in this family,

30:29.280 --> 30:30.881
she has to be called Meng Qin.

30:32.361 --> 30:34.121
She can only be your little sister.

30:35.081 --> 30:36.081
If

30:37.760 --> 30:39.361
You don't want this little sister,

30:40.321 --> 30:41.321
then fine.

30:42.881 --> 30:45.921
I'll send her abroad to study.

30:47.841 --> 30:49.200
What should be done

30:50.520 --> 30:51.641
is up to you.

31:41.680 --> 31:42.921
How come you're here today?

31:43.280 --> 31:44.401
Aren't you spending your birthday at home?

31:45.361 --> 31:47.321
I was about to head there when I saw your car up front.

31:49.720 --> 31:50.720
Happy.

31:53.200 --> 31:55.040
I can't see how "happy" is related to you right now.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.321
What's with you?

32:04.561 --> 32:05.561
Fill the glass.

32:15.161 --> 32:17.040
-Cheers. -There's no more wine.

32:17.480 --> 32:18.960
Waitress, fill the wine.

32:25.000 --> 32:26.000
How old are you?

32:26.480 --> 32:27.480
Missy.

32:28.040 --> 32:29.040
Don't go.

32:29.801 --> 32:31.240
Where do you think you're touching?

32:32.720 --> 32:34.057
What did I touch?

32:34.081 --> 32:37.520
You walked past me and touched my hand yourself.

32:37.601 --> 32:38.801
I'm not dumb.

32:39.561 --> 32:41.040
You did that on purpose.

32:43.240 --> 32:45.137
Did you look in the mirror today?

32:45.161 --> 32:46.176
I wouldn't want you even if you offered yourself.

32:46.200 --> 32:47.641
Who would touch you?

32:47.680 --> 32:50.280
You're truly shameless.

32:52.361 --> 32:53.696
Who are you calling shameless?

32:53.720 --> 32:55.057
You're the shameless one here.

32:55.081 --> 32:56.081
You hear?

32:56.121 --> 32:58.097
No upstanding lady would work in a wine bar.

32:58.121 --> 32:59.561
Watch what you say!

32:59.680 --> 33:01.040
What's wrong with working at a bar?

33:01.280 --> 33:02.680
She's earning honest money.

33:02.801 --> 33:05.057
Men with no manners and proper upbringing like you

33:05.081 --> 33:06.480
can keep your money to yourself.

33:06.801 --> 33:08.440
Who are you criticizing?

33:12.081 --> 33:13.081
Put that down.

33:13.440 --> 33:14.440
What do you think you're doing?

33:14.960 --> 33:16.161
Do you know how much this wine costs?

33:17.000 --> 33:18.081
It'd be a shame to waste it on him.

33:19.081 --> 33:20.081
Apologize right now.

33:21.081 --> 33:22.200
Apologize!

33:35.440 --> 33:36.696
Don't move!

33:36.720 --> 33:38.456
-Everyone, stand back. -Don't move!

33:38.480 --> 33:39.857
-Stop right there! -What?

33:39.881 --> 33:42.016
-You want to call the police? -Go on then.

33:42.040 --> 33:43.176
Should I call the police for you?

33:43.200 --> 33:45.176
The cameras caught everything on tape.

33:45.200 --> 33:46.881
How dare you make trouble in my shop,

33:47.401 --> 33:48.817
and harassed my female staff, too.

33:48.841 --> 33:50.520
You guys can talk to the police when they come.

33:51.561 --> 33:54.200
I can't stand men like you who get drunk and lose their heads.

33:54.601 --> 33:56.321
A group of men taking advantage of a woman?

33:56.841 --> 33:57.841
Shame on you!

33:57.960 --> 33:59.680
Enough of you. Get the hell out of my shop!

33:59.841 --> 34:00.696
-Leave! -Get lost.

34:00.720 --> 34:02.016
You're not welcomed here. Scram!

34:02.040 --> 34:03.040
Leave!

34:04.680 --> 34:05.680
You all wait.

34:08.801 --> 34:09.801
Are you two okay?

34:11.401 --> 34:12.401
That's good.

34:13.201 --> 34:14.201
You can go home early.

34:14.401 --> 34:15.401
Go back and rest.

34:15.520 --> 34:16.520
Thanks, boss.

34:17.040 --> 34:18.040
Sorry about that, guys.

34:18.681 --> 34:21.600
Sorry for the disturbance. The bill's on us today.

34:24.241 --> 34:25.241
Color me surprised.

34:25.761 --> 34:27.080
When did you learn to fight?

34:28.921 --> 34:29.921
Are you okay?

35:18.321 --> 35:19.520
You're doing so many part-time jobs.

35:20.520 --> 35:21.520
Don't you go to class?

35:22.080 --> 35:23.960
There aren't many professional courses in the final year.

35:25.440 --> 35:26.440
Are you in need of money?

35:29.560 --> 35:30.560
A little.

35:32.560 --> 35:34.080
You're not fit to work at a bar.

35:36.201 --> 35:37.841
I happen to know a better job.

35:38.681 --> 35:41.241
It pays a lot more than what you make now.

35:42.281 --> 35:44.401
I won't do anything that is against my values.

35:44.600 --> 35:46.801
Even if it pays super well.

35:49.321 --> 35:52.000
Did you think I'd let you take on weird jobs?

35:53.801 --> 35:54.801
I...

35:55.440 --> 35:57.960
When you said it pays a lot,

35:58.281 --> 35:59.281
I thought...

36:01.480 --> 36:02.560
Sorry.

36:09.721 --> 36:10.721
Go!

36:15.120 --> 36:16.120
Let's move!

36:17.201 --> 36:18.456
(There's a fire on Anhua Road.)

36:18.480 --> 36:19.801
(Dispatch one city fire engine, )

36:20.080 --> 36:21.217
(two tankers, )

36:21.241 --> 36:22.361
(and one rescue truck.)

36:23.160 --> 36:24.241
(There's a fire on Anhua Road.)

36:24.520 --> 36:25.761
(Dispatch one city fire engine, )

36:26.080 --> 36:27.080
(two tankers, )

36:27.201 --> 36:28.321
(and one rescue truck.)

36:43.520 --> 36:46.080
(The specific location is a shanty town, west entrance of Anhua Road.)

36:46.841 --> 36:49.297
Roger that. We'll arrive in two minutes.

36:49.321 --> 36:50.520
Stay in touch with the caller.

36:51.281 --> 36:52.281
(Roger that.)

36:56.721 --> 36:59.241
All vehicles, take note. The shanty town fire is spreading quickly.

36:59.440 --> 37:00.480
Gear up for action.

37:00.881 --> 37:02.801
Roger that. Gear up, everyone.

37:29.721 --> 37:31.416
-You guys got here quick. -Did you make the call?

37:31.440 --> 37:32.697
Yes, I'm from the neighborhood committee. I called for help.

37:32.721 --> 37:33.777
Is anyone trapped?

37:33.801 --> 37:35.616
No one. This zone is set for demolition.

37:35.640 --> 37:37.241
All the resident moved out last month.

37:37.640 --> 37:39.297
-Are you sure? -Water and electricity have been cut.

37:39.321 --> 37:41.440
It's inhabitable. There aren't even any stray animals.

37:46.841 --> 37:48.016
Okay. Please register yourself there.

37:48.040 --> 37:49.040
Come with me.

37:51.281 --> 37:53.817
-Jiang Yi, head to the west side. -Yes, Cap.

37:53.841 --> 37:55.781
Yang Chi, control the fire with a water gun.

37:55.821 --> 37:57.040
-Got it. -Jun Ping.

37:57.201 --> 37:59.401
The caller said no one is trapped inside.

37:59.600 --> 38:01.401
-Keep monitoring. -Will do.

38:17.640 --> 38:18.640
Set up two water guns.

38:18.801 --> 38:20.881
Hurry up! Get the fire under control.

38:20.960 --> 38:22.177
We have to stop it from spreading.

38:22.201 --> 38:23.201
Got it.

38:26.881 --> 38:27.881
Water on!

38:28.281 --> 38:30.160
-Water on! -Got it.

38:34.721 --> 38:36.600
Make sure the fire doesn't spread!

38:36.721 --> 38:37.721
Okay!

38:38.520 --> 38:39.600
Focus on extinguishing the fire.

38:39.960 --> 38:40.960
Okay.

39:02.201 --> 39:03.201
Captain.

39:03.480 --> 39:04.681
We've cleared all possible combustible.

39:04.801 --> 39:05.841
It's all abandoned houses.

39:05.921 --> 39:06.960
They are set for demolition.

39:07.600 --> 39:09.281
Get ready. We'll sweep the area.

39:09.401 --> 39:12.401
Sweep for what? The caller said the place has been evacuated, no?

39:12.440 --> 39:13.440
Those were the residents.

39:13.921 --> 39:15.560
This urban village is in a good location.

39:16.201 --> 39:18.000
To the west is a food street.

39:18.281 --> 39:19.421
And a wet market lays to the east.

39:19.761 --> 39:21.881
We can't rule out the possibility of homeless elderly living there.

39:22.080 --> 39:23.080
Okay.

39:26.921 --> 39:27.921
Check this out.

39:28.640 --> 39:30.480
Pretty fancy device, sir.

39:42.120 --> 39:43.401
Wait. Go back.

39:45.761 --> 39:46.761
Stop.

39:47.000 --> 39:48.000
Zoom in.

39:50.160 --> 39:51.681
These are untreated waste.

39:51.960 --> 39:53.440
Those bottles look like they are sold for money.

39:54.361 --> 39:55.401
There's high chance someone else is in there.

39:58.480 --> 40:01.056
What happened? Did it break down due to the intense heat?

40:01.080 --> 40:02.337
-Yang Chi. -I'm here.

40:02.361 --> 40:04.721
-Take the thermal imager. Let's go. -Got it.

40:55.241 --> 40:57.241
Captain! The hose is not long enough.

40:58.120 --> 41:00.120
-Lengthen the hose! -Yes, Cap.

41:01.480 --> 41:02.480
Continue.

41:03.761 --> 41:05.480
-Jiang Yi. -Here.

41:06.841 --> 41:08.576
-Sir. -Get backup for the captain.

41:08.600 --> 41:10.496
Got it. Liu Kai, come here!

41:10.520 --> 41:11.817
-Here. -Zhan Da Peng!

41:11.841 --> 41:13.640
-Here! -Get over here.

41:14.040 --> 41:15.040
We're going in.

41:15.560 --> 41:17.056
Got it. Thanks, Yi.

41:17.080 --> 41:19.040
Be serious! Listen to my command when we're inside.

41:19.120 --> 41:20.120
Check your equipment.

41:20.640 --> 41:21.640
Alright.

41:22.000 --> 41:23.000
Quick.

41:57.921 --> 41:58.921
Take care.

41:59.000 --> 42:00.000
Okay.

42:01.480 --> 42:03.337
Da Peng, stay close to me.

42:03.361 --> 42:04.361
The juniors are in your care.
